<km-title nodeId="9cebd2af636147d3a3aff21a1d965fc2">说明：tuya决策排查验证</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="944d91c804d74186bc415b97dc0ba724" />
<h3 nodeId="615413a29e5b41928a106922aada1ca4">一、背景</h3>
<p nodeId="6b7fab483cd5435e9ec052421e9564d8">引擎调用tuya进行处罚的时候，需要经过多个系统处理，处理链路长，出现问题的概率高，现整理排查过程中的常见问题及排查路径，方便自主排查</p>
<h3 nodeId="3cd7b756091a48e3a927a786b59a5d98">二、调用链路</h3>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1855340371/57997202769?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="886" height="196" nodeId="d462fb9ce84f4f609ceccb44eea9dc38" />
<h3 nodeId="9a23cfeb907b441ca3bf96dd4fbcc556">三、日志排查方法</h3>
<p nodeId="2575e2e2c7a148c08a396bfd4a1c4bfc">已经封装成可用的报表，可直接查询使用</p>
<p nodeId="177d435557a7432fb8854274dafef4e2"><a href="https://bi.sankuai.com/portal/24866" title="https://bi.sankuai.com/portal/24866" nodeId="d74eb89c55634987b259360942574837">https://bi.sankuai.com/portal/24866</a></p>
<p nodeId="1ce9c4f32eae4993a1455ada58d6b25b" />
<hr nodeId="f0ad038ab12746ff8c13f5bb4eec2166" />
<p nodeId="d9d5e3eed43240e2bdbb59cf29a5dab2">以下是详细流程，只建议研发使用</p>
<h4 nodeId="0d42471d8abe4225834cb975952f3e40">Zeus-引擎检测</h4>
<ul nodeId="d58fb95d9a9b41d8961f345cdca90594">
<li nodeId="15608816345b460a8c69b35d9e6d7256">
<h5 nodeId="18db605328b94dc5af5337b88802f0ce">zeus-实时引擎日志查询：<span color="#FF4A47">核实是否命中tuya处罚决策</span></h5>
<ul nodeId="d09efccdb0ac42288721bea59902d744">
<li nodeId="82fe2e91568940739fba4cd7f3426ec7">
<p nodeId="20c636c1ff5c4c58a514d01c991c2e79">实时（菜单查询）：</p>
<ul nodeId="b78cba69db3c49d0a04c853357e4fb61">
<li nodeId="689310bb78ba4852910a04101fc98776">线下环境：<a href="https://zeus.mis.rc.test.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log" title="https://zeus.mis.rc.test.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log" nodeId="cb3792f24b8f4451807ef2634878c27a">https://zeus.mis.rc.test.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log</a>（策略排查-日志查询）</li>
<li nodeId="83cbc42560564b38aa29a7352af7d894">线上环境：<a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log" title=" https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log" nodeId="4019035f96da4f91a12d875809263189"> https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log</a>（策略排查-日志查询）</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li nodeId="3f9bc7ae346a46b0b3d09b1c1b0957e0">离线hive表：ba_rc.base_log_zeus</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li nodeId="2256a11d0a7f4b1dbf3d22d5c52babbe">
<h5 nodeId="d27fd5c5565e4dfebc1ca51978d18374">zeus-离线引擎日志查询：</h5>
<ul nodeId="cf4b5dc9b32547a8a59fe095f9b5e324">
<li nodeId="9eabdc5a0b7c4c4aa039bbb3a5177654">实时-线上（mafka）：<a href="https://mafka.mws.sankuai.com/topic/20178041/detail/monitor?topicId=20178042&amp;envTag=prod&amp;buId=113&amp;action=monitor" title="https://mafka.mws.sankuai.com/topic/20178041/detail/monitor?topicId=20178042&amp;envTag=prod&amp;buId=113&amp;action=monitor" nodeId="13507e9d8cb447a4acb47fce7f73e36b">https://mafka.mws.sankuai.com/topic/20178041/detail/monitor?topicId=20178042&amp;envTag=prod&amp;buId=113&amp;action=monitor</a></li>
<li nodeId="7a590f9c315b4823878aa4ddf8e4b31b">离线hive表：ba_rc.zeus_offline_request_test_v2<span bg="rgb(255, 255, 255)">（账号以外的）、</span>ba_rc.zeus_offline_request_v2_business_3<span bg="rgb(255, 255, 255)">（只有账号空间的）</span></li>
<li nodeId="a1fb7792025943e2afa0010dbc5dc94c">
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="c1037a3854a14b39b2f758f89f99c97d">
<km-title><strong><span color="#FF4A47">处罚不生效常见问题</span></strong></km-title>
<km-content>
<ol nodeId="52d0a3a6d48b445483025e090f41fdba">
<li nodeId="e0dd592a94444eaba6485db786bea809">规则没生效：只有规则<strong>生效</strong>的情况下，才可以进行处置验证</li>
<li nodeId="0ba8eeb46237493fa30c0c541ead4114">
<p nodeId="7082aa5456164948866afd7f8576c6ca">决策附加信息拼接问题：</p>
<ol nodeId="8cda583d538d43368a3844e160a18e70">
<li nodeId="fbeea9e3cdad4332a0ecf872d8d4be9e">参数信息不全：不同处罚方式需要的参数不一样，具体参考<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1785764509#id-2.2.2%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1785764509#id-2.2.2%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="4a171b53f57349cbb69869b705af25da">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1785764509#id-2.2.2%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%84%E7%BD%9A%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E6%9E%9A%E4%B8%BE</a></li>
<li nodeId="9fdff590840b4ea6bf89e11e011ad6c4">参数评价格式不正确：注意转义，不要配多/配少了，可参考别人已经配置的可用附加信息</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="9fa2ff3dc79144a79f13546c42ee1737">任务没运行：上游依赖数据源没有就绪，任务一直在等待状态，可去「调度详情」中验证是否已经执行完成，执行日志可查看进度百分比</li>
</ol>
</km-content>
</km-collapse>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li nodeId="95552bd72a5d4f67acdf420f81cb4d70">
<h5 nodeId="2147551395a848acad16570f0068bccb">zeus-近线引擎日志查询：</h5>
<ul nodeId="20324cc53f6e45479043db160608c6f5">
<li nodeId="79835449da854aff96e4f87c12eb094e">
<p nodeId="acd39a6e1c394db4a40563d7e3f42e43">实时：</p>
<ul nodeId="fdb8cdd8a7df44d69a2c2a8457e21e53">
<li nodeId="c3d59a47bf724a39992ca7f4c407f310">测试环境（mafka）：<a href="https://mafka.mws-test.sankuai.com/topic/27238104/detail/message?topicId=27238106&amp;envTag=test&amp;buId=440&amp;action=monitor" title="https://mafka.mws-test.sankuai.com/topic/27238104/detail/message?topicId=27238106&amp;envTag=test&amp;buId=440&amp;action=monitor" nodeId="bcdfc25e68684211b5946ffe53de84fc">https://mafka.mws-test.sankuai.com/topic/27238104/detail/message?topicId=27238106&amp;envTag=test&amp;buId=440&amp;action=monitor</a>（消息管理-消息查询）</li>
<li nodeId="a4bb653444404dba8dfda116563fd712">
<p nodeId="e96e738759744d8b8ce52bdfc5fe5129">线上环境：</p>
<ul nodeId="657f7b0ba58d42138ad699017cf578ae">
<li nodeId="29b4903537d44993991053f2be9d083a"><a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log" title="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log" nodeId="a0b216fcd416466abde15866fe6a3168">https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/log</a>（策略排查-日志查询）<span color="#FA7414">无决策组件日志</span></li>
<li nodeId="add3a3a85a3b469abccb15859e74ba63"><a href="https://mafka.mws.sankuai.com/topic/20178044/detail/message?topicId=20178045&amp;envTag=prod&amp;buId=113&amp;action=monitor" title="https://mafka.mws.sankuai.com/topic/20178044/detail/message?topicId=20178045&amp;envTag=prod&amp;buId=113&amp;action=monitor" nodeId="917d979158b34e85b3c0d439f83c5f72">https://mafka.mws.sankuai.com/topic/20178044/detail/message?topicId=20178045&amp;envTag=prod&amp;buId=113&amp;action=monitor</a>（mafka-消息管理-消息查询）</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 nodeId="aa0868a7fd07407785b1fd0e3071311e">Tatooine-决策处理</h4>
